        },
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Drmcoelho/Eleicoes/git/commits/c377991a9dd645ec77df903179b0b44f4b54bfc7",
        "comment_count": 0,
        "verification": {
          "verified": true,
          "reason": "valid",
          "signature": "-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNGDXvxv\n5VVx4T+txY43be4i1Ue/StcK3HBvfO59Rd7z7OZvtA7KTTw3m1MCemfh7dUXGA54cmSbqsSrXEhm\nIws=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----",
          "payload": "tree b55579cb67120c3f8495ea814d4462cda83d4945\nparent 6fc7c8f32c2725bfb88b6c7e2a2cebb2edcf588c\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789090822 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789090822 +0000\n\nmethodology: add PREREG-0001 Cofre A estimator and candidate-vs-bloc hypothesis\n\nFixes the minimal prospective estimator for the 2026 presidential\nelection before any 2026 poll data is consulted: 14-day fieldwork_end\nwindow, valid-votes denominator, one poll per institution family,\nunweighted mean, zero house effect, empirical logit-scale intervals\ncalibrated on 2014/2018/2022 under identical rules.\n\nPreregisters the central prospective hypothesis (error attached to the\ncandidate vs. to the electoral bloc) with H+/H-/H0, a numeric decision\nrule (0.5 x the 2022 reference error), a descriptive calibration\nendpoint with its declared false-refutation rate, typed missingness,\nclosed sensitivity set, evidence-grade ceiling (B), and the freeze\nprocedure for tag pre-election-freeze-2026.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SGicfx6Y5GMkXQEVWtzD19\n",
          "verified_at": "2026-09-11T01:40:25Z"
        }
