        },
        "message": "docs: add ADR-0001 critical review of canonical constitution\n\nRecords the first adversarial reading of PROMPT.md v0.2.0 and AGENTS.md\nv1.0.0 before any ingestion. Identifies the calendar conflict with the\n2026 freeze, the retrospective-vs-prospective confirmatory distinction,\ngovernor-panel exchangeability, the candidate-vs-bloc hypothesis for\nrho_BF, and execution issues (missing CHANGELOG for the v0.1->v0.2\ncompression, PROMPT/AGENTS duplication, unbounded historical poll\ncollection). Proposes an ordered commit sequence starting with the\nCofre A prereg.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SGicfx6Y5GMkXQEVWtzD19",
