          "signature": "-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMXSTGKG\np11vkMPyLiTvtahsaaxzqf+0bL+QnG7B10R5E01+Ex36wu0wojhNslWJ71WkCH5MKWz3m8oqrqN1\n4gQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----",
          "payload": "tree 9c27aa3ad751519bda05f40d769619899dfad357\nparent 628bea69766ea997fba48bde7e05443593992cc8\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789090530 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789090530 +0000\n\ndocs: add ADR-0001 critical review of canonical constitution\n\nRecords the first adversarial reading of PROMPT.md v0.2.0 and AGENTS.md\nv1.0.0 before any ingestion. Identifies the calendar conflict with the\n2026 freeze, the retrospective-vs-prospective confirmatory distinction,\ngovernor-panel exchangeability, the candidate-vs-bloc hypothesis for\nrho_BF, and execution issues (missing CHANGELOG for the v0.1->v0.2\ncompression, PROMPT/AGENTS duplication, unbounded historical poll\ncollection). Proposes an ordered commit sequence starting with the\nCofre A prereg.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SGicfx6Y5GMkXQEVWtzD19\n",
